                             REQUIREMENTS:
                             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  - Ami-Express v3.xx or v4.xx (not yet out ;-( )
  - MultiMailer V0.66 or higher
  - Net V0.94 or higher



                             INSTALLATION:
                             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  - Make a directory doors:fido
  - Put comment into this directory
  - Copy the c.info icon into your bbs:commands/bbscmd directory
  - Edit the c.info icon. And add your personal things to it.
    Read below about the tooltypes.



                                 USAGE:
                                 ~~~~~~
  Just enter C on the MAIN screen in AmiExpress. This Util will replace
  the internal C command by an external one, but this one is compitable
  with the multimailer. Also the user can type "C 1 WHAT A NICE DAY"
  then there will be written a message to USR.1 with subject "WHAT A NICE
  DAY".  If the user uses only C then a little window will be shown with
  the names of the sysops/cosysops/special users....


                               TOOLTYPES:
                               ~~~~~~~~~~
                               
  COUNT = the total users in the multicomment door...
  USR.X = Name of the user (BOARDNAME !!!!)
  ACC.X = Accesslevel an user must have to see this name in the C window
  JOB.X = Little description what the user does....
  
  LIKE:
  ~~~~~
  
  COUNT=3
  USR.1=Tycoon/Mystic
  ACC.1=005
  JOB.1=Sysop and AE-Developer
  USR.2=Killraven/Mystic
  ACC.2=005
  JOB.2=Sysop and File manager
  USR.3=Empire
  ACC.3=050
  JOB.3=CoSysop and Snes manager
  
  See example in the C.info icon.
  


